WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.720
What is The Healthcare Paradox?

2
00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:12.760
It's the podcast that explains how America's healthcare system really works.

3
00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:18.240
The money, the rules, and the results in plain English.

4
00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:25.000
No jargon, no spin, just real data and real federal policy.

5
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:28.520
Take one example nobody in Washington can explain.

6
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:33.840
Puerto Rico receives 41% less Medicare funding than the states.

7
00:00:33.840 --> 00:00:40.200
And yet, it delivers some of the strongest Medicare Advantage quality results in the nation.

8
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:43.720
Less funding, exceptional performance.

9
00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:45.880
How is that possible?

10
00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:52.320
That's the kind of question we answer, episode by episode, with the numbers to back it up.

11
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.200
The Healthcare Paradox.

12
00:00:54.200 --> 00:01:01.920
New episodes are out now on Amazon Music, Apple Podcasts, Spotify, iHeartRadio, and YouTube.

13
00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:04.360
Or wherever you listen to your podcasts.
